From 6e1a22f9fdf9a1940ba1e700e482be19ab17ce2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:56:35 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(doctor): eighth review round - programs inside
 containers, wrapper flag values

- docker/podman/nerdctl keep their own -u/--user only before the image or
  container; the program run inside gets the generic user:pass rule
  (kubectl is no longer exempt: its -u is not a user)
- a wrapper's own flag values (sudo -u admin, nice -n 5, env -u NAME,
  timeout 5m) are not taken as the wrapped program
- encoded non-ASCII query values are shown
- tests pin the wrapper handoff; the query fuzz positions run the shortest
  and longest lengths only; docstring and long lines rewrapped

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 hermes_state_argv_secrets.py            | 72 ++++++++++++++++++-------
 tests/hermes_state/test_argv_secrets.py | 63 ++++++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 112 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hermes_state_argv_secrets.py b/hermes_state_argv_secrets.py
